# Paths removed from acp-rs-scraper history by git filter-repo --invert-paths.
# One path per line. A trailing slash is a directory prefix.
# Lines starting with # are comments and are not passed to filter-repo.
#
# These paths are Red Star site internals. The rehearsal was run against
# main 3c84eb2e (before the split). The live scrub runs only after the split
# PRs are merged, the service tree is in acp--red-star-service, and each of
# these paths is absent from the scrub tip. A path that still exists at that
# tip is skipped, not deleted: filter-repo would also drop the kept file.
#
# Kept on purpose (not listed): assets/ (logos, banner, wallpapers,
# empty-body animation), src/eggs.rs, docs/.secrets/, src/branding.rs,
# src/brands.rs once it lands, src/auth/prefs.rs, themes, crypto, storage,
# the TUI shell, and docs/history/.

